---
description: Modal headers use the X to close. Do not add Close or Cancel buttons.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Modal header: no Close or Cancel

- Every modal already has an X in the header that closes the form.
- Do not put a Close button or a Cancel button in the modal header (`actions`).
- Header actions are only for real work: Save, Submit, Send, Print, and similar.
- Use `size="sm"` on those buttons.
- For submit, use `<Button type="submit" form="your-form-id">` and set the same id on `<Form>`.
